59
00:05:04.541 --> 00:05:10.510
Supervised methods learn a mapping from
examples paired with target labels.

60
00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:19.341
Consider this worked case: Supervised learning
trains a model to classify images as cats or

61
00:05:19.341 --> 00:05:25.229
