66
00:05:48.515 --> 00:05:55.328
Preprocessing must be fitted only on permitted
training data to avoid leakage.

67
00:05:55.328 --> 00:06:02.368
Consider this worked case: Scaling features
using only training data statistics prevents

68
00:06:02.368 --> 00:06:07.062
